   "visual": "Night. Three quick cuts inside the bed tower, each a close-up on one bed with its name sign. On 'soft' (BRENDA): the burglar lies back and sinks out of sight into a heap of cushions. On 'hard' (MARCUS): the limbo bar is the pillow; his head clonks onto it, with a camera punch, face 'squint'. On 'Grandad' (GRANDAD): he lies down nose to nose with Grandad's toupee on the pillow, face 'sweat'."
  },
  {
