   "visual": "The top bed of the tower, quiet_night, with the clock face behind and below him and the party lights tiny far below. Tag JUST RIGHT pops in. The burglar, still masked, climbs in, pulls the duvet up to his chin and lies back ('crowdSurf'), face 'smile'. On 'Except' hold: long and peaceful."
