   "visual": "Down in the square the whole crowd jumps and shouts on each HUSS ('cheer'), DJ Hip Replacement slams the decks, and a shockwave ring pulses across the cobbles. HUSS 1: the bed tower beside the stage leans left. HUSS 2: it leans right. HUSS 3: it topples across the square over the crowd, with a big camera shake."
  },
