   "visual": "Beds rain down on the square. Three hero landings, one per hard cut: Grandad drops into a bed still wearing his party hat and is instantly out ('sleepy', Zzz); the mayor lands, and his top hat slides over his eyes, Zzz; the Heckler lands with his finger still pointing, Zzz. Beds thud down on the rest of the crowd. On 'sleeps' cut to a locked wide of the aftermath: the square covered in beds, every partier asleep in one with Zzz, DJ Hip Replacement asleep across the decks, the music off. In the middle, the burglar lies flat on bare cobbles ('crowdSurf', eyes wide, face 'neutral'). On 'Except' the last bed floats down and lands gently beside him with the orange cat already in it ('stare'), watching him without blinking. Iris-out on the burglar's open eyes."
